 "对部落有好处", "s": "For example, earned respect in the tribe is you do things that are good for the tribe.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [67, 85], "o": "audio/ch_t08/o11.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t08/q11.mp3", "src": [573.52, 574.46], "t": 158.66, "m": [["o", 158.66], ["o", 160.31], ["o", 161.94], ["z", 163.59], ["o", 165.75], ["o", 167.4], ["o", 169.04]], "sg": [[0, 43, "audio/t08o/s14.mp3", 0, 2.3], [44, 86, "audio/t08o/s14.mp3", 2.4, 4.05]]}, {"n": 13, "c": "the more people you're taking care of", "zh": "你照顾的人越多", "s": "The higher level you’re operating at, the more people you’re taking care of, the more you sort of earn respect and fame, and I think those are good reasons to be famous.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [38, 75], "o": "audio/ch_t08/o12.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t08/q12.mp3", "src": [616.14, 618.22], "t": 170.9, "m": [["o", 170.9], ["o", 173.66], ["o", 176.43], ["z", 179.18], ["o", 181.42], ["o", 184.18], ["o", 186.95]], "sg": [[0, 37, "audio/t08o/s20.mp3", 0, 2.42], [38, 76, "audio/t08o/s20.mp3", 2.42, 4.51], [77, 120, "audio/t08o/s20.mp3", 4.51, 6.79], [121, 169, "audio/t08o/s20.mp3", 6.79, 9.07]]}, {"n": 14, "c": "deep down", "zh": "在内心深处", "s": "and I think deep down you will know that and so it’ll be fragile and you’ll always be afraid of losing it and then you’ll be forced to perform.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [12, 21], "o": "audio/ch_t08/o13.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t08/q13.mp3", "src": [630.8, 631.39], "t": 189.98, "m": [["o", 189.98], ["o", 191.27], ["o", 192.55], ["z", 193.84], ["o", 195.82], ["o", 197.11], ["o", 198.39]], "sg": [[0, 16, "audio/t08o/s22.mp3", 0, 0.78], [17, 40, "audio/t08o/s22.mp3", 0.78, 1.8], [41, 82, "audio/t08o/s22.mp3", 1.8, 3.44], [83, 143, "audio/t08o/s22.mp3", 3.44, 5.97]]}, {"n": 15, "c": "why dodge that", "zh": "何必躲开它呢", "s": "So the kind of fame that pure actors and celebrities have, I wouldn’t want, but the kind of fame that’s earned because you did something useful, why dodge that?", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [145, 159], "o": "audio/ch_t08/o14.mp3", 